1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:01,733
Who the hell is this girl?!

2
00:00:07,133 --> 00:00:08,367
Don't mind her.

3
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:10,567
She's just the maid.

4
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:13,400
[SCOFFS]

5
00:00:14,167 --> 00:00:17,100
Smells like one too!

6
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:20,200
Daniel, dear...

7
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,267
Can you check up
on our suite?

8
00:00:23,767 --> 00:00:25,600
[SIGHS] It's taking so long.

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,733
Okay.

10
00:00:28,733 --> 00:00:35,667
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

11
00:00:50,767 --> 00:00:53,167
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

12
00:00:53,167 --> 00:00:54,467
I'll leave now.

13
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,567
Hey!

14
00:00:56,567 --> 00:00:58,433
I'm not done with you yet!

15
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:02,100
I'm sorry, ma'am. I...
don't understand.

16
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,700
If you'll insult me, could you
please do it in English?

17
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,533
So I can answer back.

18
00:01:06,533 --> 00:01:08,100
[SELENA SCOFFS] Oh.

19
00:01:08,133 --> 00:01:10,033
The maid has some attitude.

20
00:01:10,833 --> 00:01:13,300
[BRENDA] I noticed the way
you looked at Daniel.

21
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,567
You like him!

22
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,667
Don't you?

23
00:01:16,667 --> 00:01:22,567
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

24
00:01:22,567 --> 00:01:24,367
[WHISPERS] You're perfect
for each other.

25
00:01:24,367 --> 00:01:25,767
What did you say?!

26
00:01:25,767 --> 00:01:29,800
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC STINGS]

27
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:32,767
You bitch!

28
00:01:32,767 --> 00:01:36,133
[HANNAH] Ma'am, please stop!

29
00:01:36,133 --> 00:01:38,233
- Enough, please!
- [BRENDA GROANS]

30
00:01:38,233 --> 00:01:41,533
- Oh, Brenda!
- [PANTING]

31
00:01:41,567 --> 00:01:43,133
Are you okay?

32
00:01:43,567 --> 00:01:45,433
I may be a maid!

33
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,700
But I am a maid...

34
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:49,300
of honor!

35
00:01:50,367 --> 00:01:52,367
[CRYING]

36
00:01:52,367 --> 00:01:54,633
Mom!

37
00:01:54,633 --> 00:01:57,267
My nose!

38
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:03,833
Your supervisor
is gonna love this.

39
00:02:07,133 --> 00:02:10,467
[SCREAMING, CRYING]
